{"surah":77,"ayahs":["وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُرْسَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">لَٰ</span>تِ عُرْفًا","فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">عَٰ</span>صِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">فَٰ</span>تِ عَصْفًا","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَّٰ</span>شِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">رَٰ</span>تِ نَشْرًا","فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">فَٰ</span>رِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">قَٰ</span>تِ فَرْقًا","فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُلْقِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">يَٰ</span>تِ ذِكْرًا","عُذْرًا أَوْ نُذْرًا","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>مَا تُوعَدُونَ لَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">وَٰ</span>قِعٌ","فَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نُّ</span>جُومُ طُمِسَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span>ءُ فُرِجَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجِبَالُ نُسِفَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رُّسُلُ أُقِّتَتْ","لِأَىِّ يَوْمٍ أُجِّلَتْ","لِيَوْمِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفَصْلِ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>كَ مَا يَوْمُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفَصْلِ","وَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">لٌ يَ</span>و