ed-madda_normal\">لَٰ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ وَ</span>عُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">يُو</span>نٍ","وَفَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">وَٰ</span>كِهَ مِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا يَشْتَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">هُو</span>نَ","كُلُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>شْرَبُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> هَنِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">يٓـ</span>ـ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">ـَٔۢا بِ</span>مَا كُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نتُ</span>مْ تَعْمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">لُو</span>نَ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ا كَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ذَٰ</span>لِكَ نَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>زِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُحْسِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">نِي</span>نَ","وَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">لٌ يَ</span>وْمَئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ذٍ لِّ</span>لْمُكَذِّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">بِي</span>نَ","كُلُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> وَتَمَتَّعُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> قَلِيلاً إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_shafawi\">كُم مُّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>رِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">مُو</span>نَ","وَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">لٌ يَ</span>وْمَئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ذٍ لِّ</span>لْمُكَذِّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">بِي</span>نَ","وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>رْكَعُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> لَا يَرْكَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عُو</span>نَ","و